OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israel
OL,4,Adecides not to open criminal
OL,5,Ainvestigation into killing of aid
OL,6,Aworker in Gaza
OL,7,
OL,8,FForeign Minister Penny Wong said in a
OL,9,Fstatement the decision "falls far short
OL,10,Fof the accountability we expect" and
OL,11,Fsummoned the Israeli ambassador.
OL,13,FAfter meeting Wong, Ambassador Hillel
OL,14,FNewman defended the Israel Defense
OL,15,FForces (IDF) and its investigation,
OL,16,Fsaying "there was no criminal
OL,17,Fintention" and therefore "no criminal
OL,18,Fresponsibility".
